Remote Registry Verification

1.Open the GitHub Actions tab to confirm both unit-tests and build-and-package jobs succeed with green checkmarks.

2.Log in to Docker Hub to confirm the repository devops-flask-app has both the :latest and :<commit-sha> tags.

Local Runtime Pull Verification
Pull and run the published container locally:

# Pull published image from Docker Hub
docker pull <YOUR_DOCKER_USERNAME>/devops-flask-app:latest

# Run the container in detached mode
docker run -d -p 5000:5000 --name published-flask-app nithyanallasamy/devops-flask-app:latest

# Verify active endpoints
curl http://localhost:5000/
curl http://localhost:5000/health

# Clean up local test container
docker stop published-flask-app && docker rm published-flask-app

